WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:02.701
When two sprites touch, they overlap.

2
00:00:03.528 --> 00:00:07.728
An on overlap event names two kinds, like Player and Food.

3
00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:13.155
Inside it, sprite is the first one, and other sprite the second.

4
00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:20.184
The kind you choose for a sprite decides which overlap events it runs.
